Cell["\<\
Every supplied displacement contributes explicitly; reverse hoppings are not \
generated automatically.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2029086028,ExpressionUUID->"b19d46c0-64a1-4a4a-96d8-b7185065e281"],

Cell["\<\
